{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>THLPlay 是一款為 iOS、iPadOS、macOS 與 tvOS 而設的無線投影接收器，能把裝置變成智能投放中樞，適合商務簡報、家庭影院及分享相片影片的人士。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-117.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>低延遲投影與畫面標註</h2>\n<p>THLPlay 透過硬件加速解碼帶來流暢即時投影，適合會議演示、課堂教學與家庭影院。它支援 4K Ultra HD DLNA 影片播放、多螢幕與雙螢幕版面，並可在投影畫面上直接標註重點。所有影音只經本地 Wi-Fi 傳輸，不上傳個人資料到雲端，兼容 Apple TV、iPad、iPhone 與 Mac。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-101-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-102-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-103-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-104-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-105-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：THLPlay</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/thlplay/id6764002086?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.622692+00:00","quality":{